    "chunk_text": "3A III \u0dc1\u0d9a\u0ddc\u0da7\u0dc0 - \u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbc\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u200d\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc0\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dbd\u0dcf \u0da2 \u0da2\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dc1\u0d85 \u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0dbe\u0dbf \u0dc3\u0dd0\u0dc0 \u0db4 \u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dba - 2025.05.30 Part III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 30.05.2025\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\n21. Lot No. 21 Name of land: Ambagahawatta, Assessment. No. \u2013 10 (A part), Colombo Road (South); Description: Contains a garden, a part of the permanent building; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: Mallika Arachchige Ashoka Pushpakumara and Mallika Arachchige Ajith Kumara, (to finalize the land acquisition process); Extent: 0.0078 Hectare.\n\n22. Lot No. 22 Name of land: Kaballagahawatta, Assessment. No. \u2013 8 Colombo Road (South); Description: Contains a garden, a permanent building; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: Suparachchi Kankanamalage Sudathsoma, (to finalize the land acquisition process); Extent: 0.0031 Hectare.\n\nAll persons interested in the aforesaid lands are hereby required to appear personally or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat, Kolonnawa on 24.06.2025 at 10.00 a. m. and are hereby requested to notify me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 17.06.2025 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said lands, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount. P. S. P. Perera Divisional Secretary Kolonnawa. At Divisional Secretariat, Kolonnawa. 27th May, 2025. EOG 05 -0230"
