    "chunk_text": "PART III - LANDS NOTICE CALLING FOR CLAIMS TO PROPERTY OF INTESTATE REGISTRATION OF TITLE ACT, NO. 21 OF 1998 (SECTION 55) Reference the intestate property of late Mr. Mohamad Maheed Mohamad Nisham resides in the village of Mallawapitiya, in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Mallawapitiya, in the District of Kurunegala. It is hereby notified that any person/s who have a claim to or inyterest in the intestate property of the late Mr. Mohamad Maheed Mohamad Nisham in the Schedule hereto should submit his/their claim to the undersigned in writing before 27th June, 2025 stating his/their right or interest to such intestate property. In case of failure to do so, exparte action will be taken to register title under Section 55 (2) and (3) of the Registration of Title Act. No. 21 of 1998. P.C. D. SIGERA, Commissioner General of Land Title Settlement. Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Madura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla. 19th May, 2025.\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\n\u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0dca \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nN.B.\u2013 This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A - G 044466 - 04 (05/2025)\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2438/58 - 2025 \u0db8\u0dd0\u0dba\u0dd2 30 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0dc3\u0dd2\u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.05.30\n\nNo. 2438/58 \u2013 FRIDAY, MAY 30, 2025\n\n2 A\n\nIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u0ddc\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0dca \u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0