    "chunk_text": "P.C. D. SIGERA, Commissioner General of Land Title Settlement. Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla. 19th May, 2025. SCHEDULE Divisional Village Cadastral Parcel No. Extent of Land Certificate Office of Secretary\u2019s Map No. of Title No. Registration Division (Hectare) Meerigama Ambalanwatta 510234 Block 02 0.1029 2530849 Nigambo Parcel No. 59 Meerigama Kakkele 510237 Block 01 0.0298 2525064 Nigambo Parcel No. 58\n\n8 A\n\nIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u0ddc\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0dca \u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dba - 2025.05.30 PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRA ORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u201330.05.2025\n\nright or interest to such intestate property. In case of failure to do so, exparte action will be taken to register title under Section 55 (2) and (3) of the Registration of Title Act. No. 21 of 1998.\n\nP.C. D. SIGERA, Commissioner General of Land Title Settlement. Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla. 19th May, 2025. SCHEDULE\n\nDivisional Village Cadastral Parcel No. Extent of Land Certificate Office of Secretary\u2019s Map No. of Title No. Registration Division (Hectare) Meerigama Pallewela 510239 Block 01 0.0985 2509823 Nigambo Parcel No. 163 Meerigama Pallewela 510239 Block 01 0.1183 2515105 Nigambo Parcel No. 164 N.B.- Letters claiming a right to intestate property should mention the Cadastral Map number, parcel number and the entitlement of the claimant to claim such property. The top left-hand corner of the envelope should bear the phrase \u201cApplication for Intestate Property.\u201d\n\nEOG 05 - 0220/10\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF