    "chunk_text": "1AI \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3: (I) \u0dd9\u0da1\u0daf\u0dba \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.05.29\n\nP\u0d7a\u0d8b\u0d8d I: S\u0d7e\u0d7c. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 29.05.2025\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2438/46 \u2013 2025 \u0db8\u0dd0\u0250 \u0db8\u0dc3 29 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u022f\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dca\u0db4\u01af\u01e6\u0daf\u0dcf \u2013 2025.05.29No. 2438/46 \u2013 THURSDAY, MAY 29, 2025\n\n(Published by Authority)(Published by Authority)\n\nPART I: SECTION (I) \u2013 GENERALPART I: SECTION (I) \u2013 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Noti\ufb01cationsGovernment Noti\ufb01cations\n\nTHE SOCIETIES ORDINANCE\n\nBy virtue of the powers vested in me by Sections 3 and 4 of the Societies Ordinance (Chapter 123), I, Wasantha Samarasinghe, Minister of Trade, Commerce, Food Security and Cooperative Development do by this noti\ufb01cation;\n\n01. Authorize the purpose of engaging in activities that promote Religious Development and Social Service which the Society known as \u201cCELESTIAL HOPE FOUNDATION SOCIETY LIMITED\u201d situated at No. 818, Sakvithi Uyana, 8th Lane, Jayamalapura, Gampola as a purpose to which the powers and facilities of the Ordinance ought to be extended.\n\nWASANTHA SAMARASINGHE, Minister of Trade, Commerce, Food Security and Cooperative Development.\n\nMinistry of Trade, Commerce, Food Security and Cooperative DevelopmentNo. 492, Seco