of this tracing and C.M. 810038 (Sri Hemanananda Mawatha); South: C.M. 810038 (Sri Hemanananda Mawatha) and Lot Nos. 116, 97, 96, 95, 94, 93 and 92; West: Lot Nos. 116, 97, 96, 95, 94, 93 and 92.\n\n02. Lot \u2018B\u2019 \u2013 Heinz Berg alias Kainos Berg alias Heinzwatta \u2013 Extent: 0.3510 Hectare North: Lot No. 90 and Lot C of this tracing; East: Lot C of this tracing and C.M. 810038 (Sri Hemanananda Mawatha); South: C.M. 810038 (Sri Hemanananda Mawatha) and Lot A of this tracing; West: Lot A of this tracing and Lot No. 90 of C.M. 810023."
