    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dba\u0dda \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0dd9\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2438/29 - 2025 \u0db8\u0dd0\u0dba\u0dd2 \u0db8\u0dc3 28 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0db6\u0daf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.05.28\n\nNo. 2438/29 - WEDNESDAY, MAY 28, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy Ref. No.: KDS/MIN/4/8/7-6. Ministry of lands Ref. No. : 4-3/18/2021/WS/179.\n\nI hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the government intends to acquire the following land for a public purpose.\n\nDescription of land acquired to be obtained : The allotments of land, give as following name and extent, depicted in the preliminary plan No. Cadastral Map. 321001, block No. 01 sheet 02 and dated 23.12.2024, prepared by the Surveyor General, situated at the Village of Weragama, in No. 931, Weragama Grama Niladhari Division in Kanda Pahala Korale Minor Division, in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Minipe, in Kandy District, Central Province and bounded as follows :-\n\n01. Lot No. 01 - Pallekanda Kelewa; Extent: 0.0482 Hectare. On the North by : Lot No. 108 in the FVP 300; On the East by : Lot No. 2 in sheet 1; On the South by : Lot No. 108 in the FVP 300; On the west by: Lot No. 2.\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\n1A - G 044451 - 24 (05/2025)\n\n02. Lot No. 02 - Pallekanda Kelewa; Extent: 0.0556 Hectare. On the North by : Lot No. 108 in the FVP 300; On the East by : Lot No. 108 in FVP 300 and Lot No. 1 in the said plan; On the South by : Lot No. 108 in the FVP 300; On the west by: Lot No. 3.\n\nAll persons who claim ownership, interest or any other connection to the aforesaid land/servitude hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing before me on 19th of August 2025 at 10.00 a.m. at the Divisional Secretariat, Minipe."
