    "chunk_size_bytes": 2015,
    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dba\u0dda \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0dd9\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2438/28 - 2025 \u0db8\u0dd0\u0dba\u0dd2 \u0db8\u0dc3 28 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0db6\u0daf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.05.28\n\nNo. 2438/28 - WEDNESDAY, MAY 28, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice Under Section 7\n\nMy No.: GAL/LAN/ACQUIS/A13/37.\n\nLand Ref. No. : 4-3/15/2026/VE/14.\n\nI hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of Land Acquisition Act, that the government intends to acquire the following land for a public purpose.\n\nDescription of land/servitude proposed to be obtained : Allotment in extent 2.3806 Hectares described in the schedule below depicted in Cadastral Map No. 610049 in the plan and dated 11.03.2025 prepared by Surveyor General situated in the Villages of Malwana and Jayamalpura in the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 61B, Pothukoladeniya in Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division Galigamuwa in Kegalle District in Sabaragamuwa Province :\n\nSchedule 01. Lot No. 01 Name of the Land: Pindeniya Estate (Upper Part); Claimants: (01). Managing Director, Kegalle Plantations PLC, No. 310, High Level Road, Navinna, Maharagama.\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\n1A - G 044450 - 32 (05/2025)\n\n(02). Chairman, Land Reform Commission, No. 745, Kaduwela Road, Battaramulla; Extent: 2.3806 Hectares.\n\nOn the North by : Jayamalpura (An allotment); On the East by : Jayamalpura (An allotment); On the South by : Jayamalpura (An allotment); On the west by: Road of Lot No. 33 in Lot No. 2 and Jayamalpura (An allotment)\n\nAll persons interested in the aforesaid Land/servitude are hereby required to appear personally or by agents duly authorized in writing before me at Divisional Secretariat, Ruwanwella on 23.06.2025 at 10.00 a.m."
  },
