    "chunk_text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid Land/servitude are hereby required to appear personally or by agents duly authorized in writing before me at Divisional Secretariat, Ruwanwella on 23.06.2025 at 10.00 a.m.\n\nH. M. C. Susantha Herath, Divisional Secretary, Galigamuwa. At Divisional Secretariat, Galigamuwa, 22nd May, 2025. EOG 05 - 0197\n\n2 A III \u0dba\u0d9a\u0ddc\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dba\u0dda \u0dd2 \u0dc0 \u0dc1\u0dd9\u0dba \u0d9c \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dba - 2025.05.28 Part III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 28.05.2025\n\nAMENDMENT\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice Under Section 7\n\nMy Ref. No.: KOT/LND/ACQVI/01/08. Land Min. Ref. No. : LD/05/2004/FR/65. IT is hereby notified that in the advertisement published by me in the Gazette Extraordinary of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka No. 2006/11 dated 13.02.2017 under the above heading, that extent of the land to be acquired is 671.6299 Hectares, and that out of the land parts to be acquired, Lot Nos. 1472, 1474, 1475, 1476, 1477 and 1480 are removed from the list of lots of land to be acquired, as they are not relevant for acquisition.\n\nDamsara Karunajeewa Landage, Divisional Secretary, Kotapola. At Divisional Secretariat Kotapola, 22nd May, 2025. EOG 05 - 0198\n\nAMENDMENT\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice Under Section 7\n\nReference No.: Miri/DS/L/3/510224/1/13/440. IT is hereby noticed that the Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, Referred to on page 11A of the Gazette Extraordinary Notification dated 28.12.2020 and 2208/2 of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, Cadastral Map No. 510224, Block No. 01 and Sheet No.\n\n13 of as per Land Survey Amendments marked as Lot No. 440 as well as Cadastral Map No. 510224, Block No. 01 and Sheet No. 16 of hereby declare that the paragraphs relating to Lot No. 1, 2 and 3 should be amended as follows:"
