    "chunk_text": "w;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2438$26 - 2025 uehs ui 28 jeks nodod - 2025.05.28No. 2438/26 - wednesday, MAY 28, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\n1A- PG 7100 - 284 (05/2025) This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nuniversities act, no. 16 of 1978\n\nOrder under Section 27(1)(b) read with Section 25A\n\nBy virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 27(1)(b) read with Section 25A of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, Dr. Harini Amarasuriya, the Minister of Education, Higher Education and Vocational Education having obtained a report under section 70C of the aforesaid Act, in respect of the Benedict XVI Catholic International Institute of Higher Education, a company incorporated in Sri Lanka under the Companies Act, No. 7 of 2007 and bearing Registration Number PV 115017 and located at No. 495, Minuwangoda Road, Bolawalana, Negambo, being recognized as a Degree Awarding Institute, do by this Order, amend the Schedule II to the Order made under the said Act and published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 2359/14 of November 21, 2023, by the addition immediately after entry \u201cBachelor of Education Honours in Teaching English as a Second Language\u201d appearing in Column I and its corresponding entry in Column II thereof, of the entries specified under Column I and II respectively of the Schedule II hereto, subject to the conditions specified in Schedule I hereto :-\n\nSchedule I\n\nConditions\n\n1. Benedict XVI Catholic International Institute of Higher Education shall, when admitting students for the degree programme specified in Schedule II hereto in respect of the Bachelor of Science Honours in Counselling Psychology with a minimum of 120 Credits (SLQF Level 6), adhere to the minimum entry qualification of ;"
