    "chunk_text": "w;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2438$25 - 2025 uehs ui 27 jeks w\u00d5yrejdod - 2025'05'27No. 2438/25 - Tuesday, May 27, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\nUpgrading Type \u201cA\u201d Divisional Hospital \u2013 Bandarawela to a Type \u201cB\u201d Base Hospital\n\nDivisional Hospital - Bandarawela, located in the Badulla District and under the administration of the Uva Provincial Ministry of Health, has a long-term need to expand its healthcare services in order to provide secondary healthcare not only to the residents of the Bandarawela area but also to local and foreign tourists. In response to this need, the Ministry of Health and Mass Media has decided to upgrade the Type \u201cA\u201d Divisional Hospital \u2013 Bandarawela to a Type \u201cB\u201d Base Hospital with immediate effect.\n\nAccordingly, this Hospital will be developed as a Type \u201cB\u201d Base Hospital, offering the basic specialist treatment services specified in General Circular No. 01-18/2020 dated 03.03.2020 \u2013 namely, Medical, Surgical, Obstetrics & Gynaecology, Paediatrics, Anaesthesia, Psychiatry, Eye Surgery, Radiology, Pathology (including Histopathology), Dermatology, and Accident and Emergency Care. In addition, Integrated Ayurveda Wellness facilities will also be provided.\n\nFurthermore, the Hospital will continue to be administered under the Uva Provincial Council, and the head of the Hospital will be designated as the Medical Superintendent.\n\nDr. Anil Jasinghe, Secretary, Ministry of Health & Mass Media.\n\nNo. 385, \u201cSuwasiripaya\u201d,Rev. Baddegama Wimalawansa Thero Mawatha,Colombo 10,24th May, 2025. EOG 05 - 0186\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.1A - G 44439 - 34 (05/2025) This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk"
