QUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation, do hereby declare, under Subsection (1) of Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the lands described below are needed for a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act. THE allotments of land described as following names and extents depicted in the Advanced Tracing No. Maha/MDD/2021/685 dated 27.05.2022 prepared by the Surveyor General, situated at the Village of Burnside, in No. 795 Burnside Grama Niladhari Division, in Palispattuwa Korale North minor division, in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Medadumbara in Kandy District, Central Province and bounded as follows:\n\n01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Burniside Estate - Extent: 13.4952 Hectares North and East: Burnside Estate claimed by the Land Reform Commission; South: Burnside Estate claimed by the\n\nLand Reform Commission and Road (Pradeshiya Sabha); West: Road (Pradeshiya Sabha) and Burnside Estate claimed by the Land Reform Commission."
